ea\u2019s Bananas\n\nFrom (2):\n\n$$\nA_b = \\frac{1}{2} J_b = \\frac{1}{2} \\times 48 = 24\n$$\n\nSo, **Andrea has 24 bananas**.\n\n---\n\n### Step 5: Calculate Total Number of Fruits\n\nWe now know:\n\n- Andrea has 52 apples and 24 bananas.\n- Jamal has 44 apples and 48 bananas.\n\nSo total number of fruits:\n\n$$\n\\text{Total} = A_a + A_b + J_a + J_b = 52 + 24 + 44 + 48\n$$\n\n$$\n\\text{Total} = 168\n$$\n\n---\n\n### \u2705 Final Answer:\n\n$$\n\\boxed{168}\n$$", "decode_seconds": 5.5026371432468295, "draft_calls": 111, "event": "benchmark_row", "input_tokens": 66, "mapper_checkpoint_sha256": "24bc7558727ef402b14a27b261991c46b2c91ac2e701156ea75574b8beb9e40c", "method": "relay_base", "output_hash": "bd4e8d150f60180dfd838cf53a0c5c0ceb94e1981fed7010bb76e9b47d4ea83e", "output_tokens": 546, "peak_allocated_memory_bytes": 21605683712, "peak_reserved_memory_bytes": 21806186496, "problem_id": "gsm8k/1996a72dbf80558f", "profile_regions_ms": {"draft": 1942.9724035263062, "prefill_full_target": 32.05097579956055, "prefill_relay": 0.2691200077533722, "relay": 25.494496002793312, "unattributed_runtime": 100.10161466151476, "verification_full_target": 3401.7485332489014}, "proposal_lengths": [7, 7, 7, 7, 7, 7, 7, 7, 7, 7, 7, 7, 7, 7, 7, 7, 7, 7, 7, 7, 7, 7, 7, 7, 7, 7, 7, 7, 7, 7, 7, 7, 7, 7, 7, 7, 7, 7, 7, 7, 7, 7, 7, 7, 7, 7, 7, 7, 7, 7, 7, 7, 7, 7, 7, 7, 7, 7, 7, 7, 7, 7, 7, 7, 7, 7, 7, 7, 7, 7, 7, 7, 7, 7, 7, 7, 7, 7, 7, 7, 7, 7, 7, 7, 7, 7, 7, 7, 7, 7, 7, 7, 7, 7, 7, 7, 7, 7, 7, 7, 7, 7, 7, 7, 7, 7, 7, 7, 7, 7, 3], "rank": 0, "reference_answer": "168", "repetition": 0, "request_seconds": 5.5026371432468295, "reserved_memory_after_bytes": 21806186496, "reserved_memory_before_bytes": 21774729216, "sampling_seed": 161334612412439926, "sampling_temperature": 0.6, "target_calls": 111, "time_to_first_token_seconds": 0.0, "turn_index": 0, "verify_count": 111}
